    "title": "Couple sues city, Island Brewing Company over brewery's outdoor live music - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Evelyn Spence ,\n5 hours ago A couple filed a lawsuit last week against the city of Carpinteria and Island Brewing Company (IBC) — a brewery located on Sixth Street across the railroad tracks from the city’s beach neighborhood — alleging IBC’s outdoor live music is too loud and in violation of city noise policies. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
